# Binary assets in this repository are stored as regular Git blobs.
# Git LFS is intentionally NOT used.
# "binary" is a Git attribute macro (-diff -merge -text): it prevents text/CRLF
# conversion and binary diff/merge, but does NOT invoke any LFS filter.

